      "anchor": "[NEW-GRAPH-PLOT:REQ-001]",
      "body": "The existing calculator shall provide a graph plotter that accepts a user-supplied `y=f(x)` function and presents its plotted curve. This is the integrated-calculator scope selected in clarification `Q-001`. *(S1)*",
