    {
      "anchor": "[NEW-GRAPH-PLOT:REQ-002]",
      "body": "When the supplied graph inputs specify a circle centered at `(0,0)` with radius `6`, the plotter shall render the complete circle. This fulfills the pinned circle-test request [scope:SRI-15d4e5bd263a] and the full-circle clarification `Q-004`. *(S2)*",
